Z||000000||BENGAL4||11-08-2001||07:54 PM||||The 5.0 Mustang. He was at a gas station and he followed me to a grocery store. We talked for a little while and looked at each others cars. The only mods he had done, were the pulleys. He said it shocked the $hit out of him that he couldnt catch a Fiero, but he was impressed with the swap. I told him that it is a stock engine, it just didn't come with this car. He said, "But it should have" and I agreed. Very nice kid, but he did say he would leave me alone in the future, though he couldn't say the same for his Mustang buddies that he warned about me. <P>See, we can all get along.<P>Bill<BR>86GT<BR>3800 II S/C ||||reg||10
